      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAGIC CAPTAIN (10) again drew a wide gate last start but did a good job, beaten a neck into third at Pinjarra over 2185m. Drawn to enjoy a cosy run but might need things to go his way at some stage. Stepping up a level this time but on his best form he is capable of testing this line-up. RAKLOU NZ (6) was out of the money two back at this track. Turned in a better run last time out when second over 2130m at this track, beaten 4 metres. Good enough to take out a race like this. IDEAL INTEREST (4) was responsible for a better effort last time out when third over 1730m here. Should run a big race. PRIDDAH (1) is in the mix following a respectable second at his most recent appearance over 2130m at this circuit. Include from the coveted pegs draw.",
